273 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Youth leadership is not about waiting for  permission to act. It is about breaking the climate bubble, building bridges across  generations, and transforming daily experiences  into strategies that can shape negotiations and outcomes. That is why training, strategy, and intergenerational collaboration are essential to turn voices into seeds of impact. Like every seed, it requires care and if we want them to grow, each of us must contribute, even if only once, to watering them.)
/E (Youth leadership is not about waiting for  permission to act. It is about breaking the climate bubble, building bridges across  generations, and transforming daily experiences  into strategies that can shape negotiations and outcomes. That is why training, strategy, and intergenerational collaboration are essential to turn voices into seeds of impact. Like every seed, it requires care and if we want them to grow, each of us must contribute, even if only once, to watering them.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
274 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (This is not only a youth call. It is an invitation to civil society, governments, and institutions to thrive together. Because access to knowledge - across languages and in real time - ensures neither nature nor humanity is alone in this struggle. Our collective survival depends on acting as one. One planet. )
/E (This is not only a youth call. It is an invitation to civil society, governments, and institutions to thrive together. Because access to knowledge - across languages and in real time - ensures neither nature nor humanity is alone in this struggle. Our collective survival depends on acting as one. One planet. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [10]
>>
