/T (Inclusion means more than just a seat at the table - it  means creating conditions where every voice can be  heard. Youth participation in climate negotiations has grown over the past thirty years, yet the space still remains highly technical and often inaccessible. We believe that in order to influence an ecosystem, one must first understand it.)
