>>
endobj
346 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Global Youth Coalition \(GYC\) is a youth-led international platform empowering changemakers globally. Founded at COP27, GYC bridges grassroots action with global climate negotiations. Through intergenerational campaigns like Reeforesting4Peace and the Avocado Framework, it channels youth energy into high-impact policy and community solutions. GYC centers digital innovation, knowledge transfer, and youth-led diplomacy. Its mission is to amplify underrepresented voices and equip the next generation of global climate leaders.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
347 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (About Oxford Net Zero )
/Pg 14 0 R
>>
endobj
348 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Oxford Net Zero brings together experts from across the University to address the critical issue of how to reach global net zero emissions. It includes academics from disciplines including Anthropology, Biology, Earth Sciences, Geography, Law, Business and Governance. Our mission is to inform effective and ambitious climate action among those setting net zero targets in institutions and governments across the globe.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
